  "Configuration": "配置",
  "Import multiple presets with ease by simply copying them. Visland will read your clipboard and attempt to import whatever you copy. Your clipboard will be cleared upon enabling.": "只需连续复制即可轻松导入多个预设。Visland 会读取剪贴板并尝试导入所复制的内容。启用时会清空剪贴板。",
  "Enables \"Gather Mode\" when on your Island Sanctuary automatically when commencing a route.": "在无人岛开始执行路线时，自动启用“采集模式”。",
  "Applies to non-island routes only. Will auto gather the item in the \"Item Target\" field and use the best actions available.": "仅适用于无人岛以外的路线。自动采集“物品目标”指定的物品，并使用当前可用的最佳技能。",
  "Node scanning will check the object table for nearby targetable gathering points, failing that will use your gatherer's reveal node ability and navigate to that. It will create a new phantom waypoint with the aforementioned information and navigate to it. Every phantom waypoint will also node scan. These special waypoints do not get saved to the route.": "采集点扫描会检查对象列表中附近可选中的采集点；若未找到，则使用采集职业的探测技能并前往探测到的位置。系统会根据这些信息创建临时途经点并前往该点。每个临时途经点也会扫描采集点。这些特殊途经点不会保存到路线中。",
  "Loads Overseas Casuals archive recommendations for the mapped season, then applies the favour mode from Settings.": "加载对应赛季的 Overseas Casuals 存档推荐，然后应用设置中选择的偏好模式。",
  "Legacy importer for schedules copied from Discord.\nThe importer detects item names (without \"Isleworks\" et al) on each line.\nYou can copy an entire workshop schedule from discord, junk included.": "用于导入从 Discord 复制的排程的旧版导入器。\n导入器会识别每行中的物品名称（省略“Isleworks”等前缀）。\n可以直接复制 Discord 中的完整工坊排程，无需删除无关内容。",
  "Manual overrides for the currently loaded schedule. Archive loads already apply the favour mode from Settings.": "手动覆盖当前已加载的排程。加载存档时已应用设置中选择的偏好模式。",
  "ClearItemTarget": "清除物品目标",
  "Gathering routes can only run inside Island Sanctuary and cannot contain waypoints in other territories.": "采集路线只能在无人岛内运行，且不能包含其他区域的途经点。",
  "Gathering routes are available only inside Island Sanctuary.": "采集路线仅支持在无人岛内运行。",
  "Automatic navigation requires vnavmesh. Please install and enable it.": "自动寻路需要 vnavmesh，请安装并启用该插件。",
  "vnavmesh could not start navigation. The route has been stopped.": "vnavmesh 无法启动寻路，路线已停止。",
  "Automatic navigation uses vnavmesh.": "自动寻路使用 vnavmesh。",
  "Automatically optimize gathering routes": "自动优化采集路线",
  "Stuck timeout (seconds)": "卡住超时（秒）",
  "Global Route Editing Options": "全局路线编辑选项",
  "Global Route Operation Options": "全局路线运行选项",
  "Navigation retry limit": "寻路重试次数",
  "Maximum recalculations per waypoint after getting stuck or navigation failing to start. Default: 3. After retries fail, try a different movement path via nearby intermediate points to the same waypoint. The gathering route and target stay unchanged. Stop if no usable detour remains. 0 tries detours immediately.": "卡住或寻路启动失败后，每个途经点最多重新计算的次数，默认 3 次。重试仍失败时，尝试经附近中间点绕行到同一途经点，采集路线和目标保持不变。无可用绕行路径时停止。设为 0 时直接尝试绕行。",
  "Navigation retries exhausted. Trying an alternative movement path to the same waypoint.": "寻路重试次数已用尽，正在尝试其他移动路径前往当前途经点。",
  "No alternative movement path is available. Gathering has stopped at the current waypoint.": "没有可用的替代移动路径，已在当前途经点停止采集。",
  "Automatic movement": "自动移动",
  "Mount": "坐骑",
  "Mount roulette": "随机坐骑",
  "Allow flight": "允许飞行",
  "Mount distance (yalms)": "坐骑距离（星码）",
  "Flight distance (yalms)": "飞行距离（星码）",
  "Choose walking, riding or flying from the distance to each new target. Default thresholds: 20 and 40 yalms. Movement mode is fixed for that leg. Mounting or takeoff failures fall back to walking or ground riding. Legacy waypoint movement settings are ignored.": "根据每个新目标的距离自动选择步行、骑行或飞行，默认阈值为 20 和 40 星码。每段路程的移动模式固定，上坐骑或起飞失败时回退为步行或地面骑行。旧途经点的移动模式设置不再生效。",
  "Optimizes independent gathering stops when starting a full route. Waits and route jumps keep their order. Saved routes are unchanged. Distance estimates use straight lines; vnavmesh handles obstacles during navigation.": "启动完整路线时优化独立采集点的访问顺序，保留等待和路线跳转步骤，不修改已保存的路线。距离按直线估算，实际移动由 vnavmesh 绕过障碍。",
  "After this many seconds without movement, try jumping while navigation continues. If horizontal movement stays below 0.5 yalms for 3 seconds, recalculate the path and use detours after the retry limit. Default: 10 seconds; 0 disables detection. Pauses, gathering and mounting do not count.": "持续未移动超过设定时间后，先保持寻路并尝试跳跃；3 秒内水平位移仍不足 0.5 星码时，重新计算路径，重试用尽后尝试绕行。默认 10 秒，0 表示关闭检测。暂停、采集和上坐骑期间不计时。",
  "Stop when inventory is full": "库存已满时停止",
  "Stop only when every material currently unlocked for this gathering node is at its carrying limit. Materials locked by island progression or uncrafted tools are excluded. Continue if any available material has room. Unknown nodes do not trigger a stop.": "仅当当前采集点所有已解锁材料的库存均达到持有上限时停止。按角色实际无人岛进度和已制作工具判断，未解锁材料不计入；只要还有可采材料未满就继续。无法识别的采集点不会触发停止。",
  "Gathering stopped: all unlocked materials at the current node are at capacity.": "采集已停止：当前采集点所有已解锁材料的库存均已达到上限。",
  "Landing attempts exhausted or timed out. Gathering has stopped.": "降落候选点已用尽或总等待超时，采集已停止。"
}
